                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A sword and magic version of L4D2.  The first two difficulties can be easily breezed through by spamming attacks.  Champions and higher difficulties need a better understanding about the game mechanics to conquer.  Beating the legendary difficult with bots is a satisfactory experience. \r\n\r\nAll achievements can be obtained by playing with bots only.  Legendary Skittergate is the most difficult achievement here.  Others are mainly grinding, but you will need those practices to be familiar with enemies, dodges and parries anyway.  \r\n\r\nWhen playing on steam machine, you could have some issues with the launcher.  Luckily, there's this temporary_launcher_workaround beta version to bypass it.  After using this version, I have no more crashing issue.\r\n",
